  "body": "Currently the type of `body` parameter in the Response constructor is `optional BodyInit`. That means we cannot create a null body response with specifying the second `init` parameter.\n\nReported at https://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=524500.\nDeclaring the parameter as nullable fixes it, I think.\n",
